<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Blossom (Live)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Porter Robinson"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Secret Sky 2021 (Live)"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1864859262"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="235518886"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="chan-air"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:13.228"><div begin="00:10.371" end="03:13.228"><p begin="00:10.371" end="00:15.091" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L0"><span begin="00:10.371" end="00:11.091">I</span> <span begin="00:11.091" end="00:12.254">clo</span><span begin="00:12.254" end="00:12.516">se</span> <span begin="00:12.886" end="00:13.261">my</span> <span begin="00:13.261" end="00:14.457">eye</span><span begin="00:14.457" end="00:15.091">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我闭上双眼</span></p><p begin="00:15.091" end="00:18.605" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:15.091" end="00:15.481">For</span> <span begin="00:15.481" end="00:15.753">once</span> <span begin="00:15.753" end="00:16.056">I</span> <span begin="00:16.056" end="00:16.388">don't</span> <span begin="00:16.388" end="00:17.206">have</span> <span begin="00:17.206" end="00:17.446">to</span> <span begin="00:17.446" end="00:18.605">try</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这一次不必再尝试</span></p><p begin="00:19.179" end="00:22.262" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:19.179" end="00:19.487">I'm</span> <span begin="00:19.487" end="00:19.801">well</span><span begin="00:19.801" end="00:20.204">-wi</span><span begin="00:20.204" end="00:20.531">shing</span> <span begin="00:20.531" end="00:21.217">for</span> <span begin="00:21.217" end="00:21.482">a</span> <span begin="00:21.482" end="00:22.262">life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我幻想着一种生活</span></p><p begin="00:22.593" end="00:25.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:22.593" end="00:22.720">I</span> <span begin="00:22.720" end="00:22.986">pic</span><span begin="00:22.986" end="00:23.315">ture</span> <span begin="00:23.315" end="00:23.778">you</span> <span begin="00:23.778" end="00:24.903">hap</span><span begin="00:24.903" end="00:25.460">py</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你在其中快乐无比</span></p><p begin="00:29.461" end="00:33.511" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:29.461" end="00:29.793">In</span> <span begin="00:29.793" end="00:30.084">the</span> <span begin="00:30.084" end="00:31.218">weed</span><span begin="00:31.218" end="00:31.446">s</span> <span begin="00:31.931" end="00:32.261">we</span> <span begin="00:32.261" end="00:33.251">walk</span><span begin="00:33.251" end="00:33.511">ed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们漫步走在丛生百草之中</span></p><p begin="00:33.909" end="00:37.357" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:33.909" end="00:34.236">Your</span> <span begin="00:34.236" end="00:34.508">hand</span> <span begin="00:34.508" end="00:34.844">run</span><span begin="00:34.844" end="00:35.198">ning</span> <span begin="00:35.198" end="00:35.824">through</span> <span begin="00:35.824" end="00:36.055">the</span> <span begin="00:36.055" end="00:37.357">moss</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你的指尖在植被间略过</span></p><p begin="00:38.385" end="00:41.152" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:38.385" end="00:38.706">I</span> <span begin="00:38.706" end="00:39.044">was</span> <span begin="00:39.044" end="00:39.353">so</span> <span begin="00:39.353" end="00:40.217">lost</span> <span begin="00:40.217" end="00:40.494">in</span> <span begin="00:40.494" end="00:41.152">thought</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我曾深陷于思绪困境中</span></p><p begin="00:41.396" end="00:44.161" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:41.396" end="00:41.573">But</span> <span begin="00:41.573" end="00:41.877">you</span> <span begin="00:41.877" end="00:42.191">were</span> <span begin="00:42.191" end="00:42.504">there</span> <span begin="00:42.504" end="00:43.628">li</span><span begin="00:43.628" end="00:44.161">ving</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但有你将我留在身边</span></p><p begin="00:45.721" end="00:48.892" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:45.721" end="00:45.879">You've</span> <span begin="00:45.879" end="00:46.472">ta</span><span begin="00:46.472" end="00:46.839">ken</span> <span begin="00:46.839" end="00:47.071">me</span> <span begin="00:47.071" end="00:48.155">with</span> <span begin="00:48.155" end="00:48.892">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">共同居住于此地</span></p><p begin="00:53.994" end="00:58.389" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:53.994" end="00:54.361">Can</span> <span begin="00:54.361" end="00:54.834">I</span> <span begin="00:54.834" end="00:56.135">slow</span> <span begin="00:56.614" end="00:56.931">the</span> <span begin="00:56.931" end="00:58.114">day</span><span begin="00:58.114" end="00:58.389">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我可否放慢时间</span></p><p begin="00:58.773" end="01:02.506" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:58.773" end="00:59.174">I'll</span> <span begin="00:59.174" end="00:59.435">wish</span> <span begin="00:59.435" end="00:59.736">that</span> <span begin="00:59.736" end="01:00.087">I'll</span> <span begin="01:00.087" end="01:00.740">find</span> <span begin="01:00.740" end="01:01.096">the</span> <span begin="01:01.096" end="01:02.506">faith</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我希望我终能找到信仰</span></p><p begin="01:02.956" end="01:06.231" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:02.956" end="01:03.301">I'll</span> <span begin="01:03.301" end="01:03.632">die</span> <span begin="01:03.632" end="01:03.979">and</span> <span begin="01:03.979" end="01:04.294">I'll</span> <span begin="01:04.294" end="01:05.079">save</span> <span begin="01:05.079" end="01:05.407">your</span> <span begin="01:05.407" end="01:06.231">place</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我宁愿一死 为你空下一席之地</span></p><p begin="01:06.383" end="01:09.451" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:06.383" end="01:06.546">And</span> <span begin="01:06.546" end="01:06.831">you'll</span> <span begin="01:06.831" end="01:07.174">ne</span><span begin="01:07.174" end="01:07.496">ver</span> <span begin="01:07.496" end="01:08.493">suf</span><span begin="01:08.493" end="01:09.451">fer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也不忍你再受苦受难</span></p><p begin="01:10.754" end="01:13.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:10.754" end="01:11.214">We'll</span> <span begin="01:11.214" end="01:11.714">stay</span> <span begin="01:11.714" end="01:11.901">to</span><span begin="01:11.901" end="01:13.150">ge</span><span begin="01:13.150" end="01:13.920">ther</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们定会能相伴永远</span></p><p begin="01:18.476" end="01:23.005" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:18.476" end="01:18.937">Oh</span> <span begin="01:18.937" end="01:19.325">it's</span> <span begin="01:19.325" end="01:20.544">not</span> <span begin="01:21.280" end="01:21.755">al</span><span begin="01:21.755" end="01:23.005">right</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可我仍不安心</span></p><p begin="01:23.442" end="01:26.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:23.442" end="01:23.730">That</span> <span begin="01:23.730" end="01:24.075">one</span> <span begin="01:24.075" end="01:24.397">day</span> <span begin="01:24.397" end="01:24.795">we're all</span> <span begin="01:24.795" end="01:25.427">out</span> <span begin="01:25.427" end="01:25.777">of</span> <span begin="01:25.777" end="01:26.890">time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">有朝一日 我们终会走到时光尽头</span></p><p begin="01:27.545" end="01:30.555" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:27.545" end="01:27.830">I'll</span> <span begin="01:27.830" end="01:28.152">write</span> <span begin="01:28.152" end="01:28.506">you</span> <span begin="01:28.506" end="01:28.786">a</span><span begin="01:28.786" end="01:29.407">no</span><span begin="01:29.407" end="01:29.792">ther</span> <span begin="01:29.792" end="01:30.555">life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我愿为你书写来世</span></p><p begin="01:30.707" end="01:33.486" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:30.707" end="01:30.837">I'm</span> <span begin="01:30.837" end="01:31.304">sor</span><span begin="01:31.304" end="01:31.542">ry</span> <span begin="01:31.542" end="01:31.883">for</span> <span begin="01:31.883" end="01:32.967">cry</span><span begin="01:32.967" end="01:33.486">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我为我流泪深怀歉意</span></p><p begin="01:34.719" end="01:37.961" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:34.719" end="01:35.020">It's</span> <span begin="01:35.020" end="01:35.609">just</span> <span begin="01:35.609" end="01:35.780">that</span> <span begin="01:35.780" end="01:36.071">I</span> <span begin="01:36.071" end="01:37.077">love</span> <span begin="01:37.077" end="01:37.961">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只是因为 我实在太爱你了</span></p><p begin="01:44.892" end="01:51.818" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:44.892" end="01:45.362">I</span> <span begin="01:45.362" end="01:45.619">had</span> <span begin="01:45.619" end="01:47.739">lost</span> <span begin="01:48.013" end="01:49.335">my</span> <span begin="01:50.186" end="01:51.818">sight</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的视线逐渐模糊</span></p><p begin="01:53.834" end="02:01.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:53.834" end="01:54.253">So</span> <span begin="01:54.253" end="01:54.493">you</span> <span begin="01:54.493" end="01:56.169">sang</span> <span begin="01:56.169" end="01:56.369">to</span> <span begin="01:56.369" end="01:57.220">me</span> <span begin="01:58.339" end="01:58.617">the</span> <span begin="01:58.617" end="01:59.252">beau</span><span begin="01:59.252" end="01:59.602">ty</span> <span begin="01:59.602" end="02:00.325">you'd</span> <span begin="02:00.325" end="02:00.742">been</span> <span begin="02:00.742" end="02:01.372">see</span><span begin="02:01.372" end="02:01.980">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你就将沿途的美好一一化作歌声唱响</span></p><p begin="02:02.396" end="02:07.766" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="02:02.396" end="02:02.629">If</span> <span begin="02:02.629" end="02:03.016">I</span> <span begin="02:03.016" end="02:04.890">can't</span> <span begin="02:04.890" end="02:06.400">stop</span> <span begin="02:06.841" end="02:07.766">time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">倘若我阻止不了时间</span></p><p begin="02:09.569" end="02:17.567" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="02:09.569" end="02:09.921">I'll</span> <span begin="02:09.921" end="02:10.320">build</span> <span begin="02:10.320" end="02:10.604">a</span> <span begin="02:10.604" end="02:11.425">world</span> <span begin="02:12.554" end="02:13.482">where</span> <span begin="02:14.435" end="02:15.526">God</span> <span begin="02:15.526" end="02:15.842">can</span><span begin="02:15.842" end="02:16.188">not</span> <span begin="02:16.188" end="02:16.617">take</span> <span begin="02:16.617" end="02:17.567">us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我会构建一个与世隔绝之地</span></p><p begin="02:17.567" end="02:24.262" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="02:17.567" end="02:18.017">There's</span> <span begin="02:18.017" end="02:18.244">no</span> <span begin="02:18.244" end="02:19.907">need</span> <span begin="02:20.246" end="02:20.571">to</span> <span begin="02:20.571" end="02:21.796">think</span> <span begin="02:22.647" end="02:22.913">of</span> <span begin="02:22.913" end="02:24.262">time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在那里不必忧虑时间流逝</span></p><p begin="02:26.933" end="02:30.383" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="02:26.933" end="02:27.223">But</span> <span begin="02:27.223" end="02:28.330">then</span> <span begin="02:29.171" end="02:29.347">you</span> <span begin="02:29.347" end="02:30.383">said</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但你说</span></p><p begin="02:31.274" end="02:34.872" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="02:31.274" end="02:31.596">"Don't</span> <span begin="02:31.596" end="02:31.891">think</span> <span begin="02:31.891" end="02:32.209">of</span> <span begin="02:32.209" end="02:32.517">the</span> <span begin="02:32.517" end="02:33.194">time</span> <span begin="02:33.194" end="02:33.546">that's</span> <span begin="02:33.546" end="02:34.872">left</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所剩多久时间都不要紧</span></p><p begin="02:35.372" end="02:38.645" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="02:35.372" end="02:35.710">You're</span> <span begin="02:35.710" end="02:36.058">spen</span><span begin="02:36.058" end="02:36.381">ding</span> <span begin="02:36.381" end="02:36.682">it</span> <span begin="02:36.682" end="02:37.289">in</span> <span begin="02:37.289" end="02:37.755">your</span> <span begin="02:37.755" end="02:38.645">head</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你已为此困扰了太久</span></p><p begin="02:38.645" end="02:41.518" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="02:38.645" end="02:38.794">I</span> <span begin="02:38.794" end="02:39.109">just</span> <span begin="02:39.109" end="02:39.360">want</span> <span begin="02:39.360" end="02:39.681">you</span> <span begin="02:39.681" end="02:40.646">laugh</span><span begin="02:40.646" end="02:41.518">ing"</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我只想你开心快乐便好</span></p><p begin="02:42.551" end="02:45.728" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="02:42.551" end="02:42.703">I'm</span> <span begin="02:42.703" end="02:43.212">sor</span><span begin="02:43.212" end="02:43.492">ry</span> <span begin="02:43.492" end="02:43.700">for</span> <span begin="02:43.700" end="02:45.003">cry</span><span begin="02:45.003" end="02:45.728">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我为我流泪深怀歉意</span></p><p begin="02:47.306" end="02:51.873" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="02:47.306" end="02:47.563">I</span> <span begin="02:47.563" end="02:48.019">just</span> <span begin="02:48.019" end="02:48.322">want</span> <span begin="02:48.322" end="02:48.822">you</span> <span begin="02:48.822" end="02:50.060">hap</span><span begin="02:50.060" end="02:51.873">py</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只是因为 我实在太爱你了</span></p><p begin="02:55.776" end="03:02.878" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:55.776" end="02:56.114">So</span> <span begin="02:56.114" end="02:56.508">at</span> <span begin="02:56.508" end="02:57.958">last</span> <span begin="02:59.126" end="03:00.586">good</span><span begin="03:01.410" end="03:02.878">bye</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">最后 再见</span></p><p begin="03:04.685" end="03:08.636" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="03:04.685" end="03:05.117">I'll</span> <span begin="03:05.117" end="03:05.490">be</span> <span begin="03:05.490" end="03:07.542">hap</span><span begin="03:07.542" end="03:08.636">py</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">认识你</span></p><p begin="03:09.732" end="03:12.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="03:09.732" end="03:10.993">Just</span> <span begin="03:10.993" end="03:11.257">to</span> <span begin="03:11.257" end="03:11.656">have</span> <span begin="03:11.656" end="03:12.059">known</span> <span begin="03:12.059" end="03:12.730">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">是我一生至幸</span></p><p begin="03:13.144" end="03:13.228" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="03:13.144" end="03:13.444">And</span> <span begin="03:13.444" end="03:13.805">we</span> <span begin="03:13.805" end="03:14.873">wish</span><span begin="03:14.873" end="03:15.199">ed</span> <span begin="03:15.654" end="03:16.017">each</span> <span begin="03:16.017" end="03:17.204">o</span><span begin="03:13.228" end="03:13.228">ther</span> <span begin="03:13.228" end="03:13.228">well</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">愿彼此能安得始终</span></p></div></body></tt>